          </svg>
          <span>Bedrock.engineer</span>
        </div>

        <h1 id="hero-heading">
          Unlock. <wbr />Visualize.<wbr /> Engineer. <br />Your Subsurface Data
        </h1>

        <p class="md:text-lg">
          Ground investigation data and geotechnical models sit in specialist
          software the rest of your project can't reach. We make it accessible
          in your web maps, GIS, BIM tools, and digital twin platforms.
        </p>

        <div class="flex gap-4 justify-center flex-wrap mt-12">
          <a
            href="https://cal.com/bedrock.engineer"
            class="cta-button-inverted"
            target="_blank"
          >
            Schedule Discovery Call
          </a>
          <a href="/demos" class="cta-button-secondary-inverted">View Demos</a>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="header-controls">
