    <div class="section-wrapper texture-607">
      <section class="section">
        <h2 class="heading-2 anchor-heading" id="what-we-do">
          A Software Consultancy for Subsurface Data
          <a class="anchor-link" href="#what-we-do">#</a>
        </h2>

        <div class="grid-auto-fit gap-y-8">
          <div>
            <p class="paragraph" style="margin-block-end: var(--space-m)">
              We build tools and workflows that connect your ground
              investigation data, ground models, and analysis results to the
              platforms your project already runs on.
            </p>

            <h3 class="heading-4">What we do:</h3>
            <ul class="services-list paragraph">
              <li>
                Convert legacy formats (AGS, GEF/CPT, gINT) into geospatial
                formats like GeoPackage or PostGIS databases
              </li>
              <li>
                Build web applications for CPT data, engineering model
                visualization (Plaxis, Deltares D-Series), and interactive 3D
                maps
              </li>
              <li>
                Integrate ground investigation data into digital twin platforms
              </li>
              <li>
                Automate workflows connecting subsurface data to QGIS, BIM
                tools, and databases
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <HoverLogo class="place-self-center" />
        </div>

        <div class="section-link-center">
          <a href="/services" class="section-link"> Our services → </a>
        </div>
      </section>
